FONT-UTIL
=========

A git submodule (see docs/contrib.md), not a copy of the sources:

url    = https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/font/util.git
tag    = font-util-1.4.2
commit = 5c92c11482e017fa7210a71b6f44e40042816209
date   = 2026-04-25

Used for ucs2any.c and its map-* files only (the ISO8859-*, KOI8-R and
JISX0201 conversions of the misc fonts), built by tools/desktop/build-fonts.sh
with the base compiler. bdftruncate and the fontutil.m4 and .pc files are
not used. Nothing is written into the submodule.

